    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Job Rejection Emails: The Adventure Game!&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The resurrection of the Demon Lord is near!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, people's faith has waned, and the church's power of &quot;prayer&quot; is nearly depleted\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the role of Elise, a third-year university student and novice sister, and gather &quot;job rejection emails&quot; through job hunting to restore the power of prayer and defeat the Demon Lord!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a <strong>training simulation</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strengthen Elise\u2019s stats through multiple playthroughs and aim to reach different story endings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features a <strong>multi-ending system</strong>.</p></li></ul>",
